  "gloss": "to comb (hair); to run a comb through",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to comb (hair); to run a comb or brush through",
      "explanation": "To pass a comb or brush through hair to untangle and smooth it. Written {梳|と}かす in kanji, but the kana spelling is far more common in everyday writing."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
